text.en:
Rotate the priority order per branch (the default `nxt_grant <= (others => '0');` line stays above the case).
```vhdl
case last_grant is
    when "00" =>
        if    req(1) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0010";
        elsif req(2) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0100";
        elsif req(3) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "1000";
        elsif req(0) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0001";
        end if;
    when "01" =>
        if    req(2) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0100";
        elsif req(3) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "1000";
        elsif req(0) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0001";
        elsif req(1) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0010";
        end if;
    when "10" =>
        if    req(3) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "1000";
        elsif req(0) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0001";
        elsif req(1) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0010";
        elsif req(2) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0100";
        end if;
    when others =>
        if    req(0) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0001";
        elsif req(1) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0010";
        elsif req(2) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0100";
        elsif req(3) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "1000";
        end if;
end case;
```

text.es:
Rota el orden de prioridad en cada rama (la línea por defecto `nxt_grant <= (others => '0');` se queda encima del case).
```vhdl
case last_grant is
    when "00" =>
        if    req(1) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0010";
        elsif req(2) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0100";
        elsif req(3) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "1000";
        elsif req(0) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0001";
        end if;
    when "01" =>
        if    req(2) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0100";
        elsif req(3) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "1000";
        elsif req(0) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0001";
        elsif req(1) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0010";
        end if;
    when "10" =>
        if    req(3) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "1000";
        elsif req(0) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0001";
        elsif req(1) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0010";
        elsif req(2) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0100";
        end if;
    when others =>
        if    req(0) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0001";
        elsif req(1) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0010";
        elsif req(2) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "0100";
        elsif req(3) = '1' then nxt_grant <= "1000";
        end if;
end case;
```
